flowchart TD
  Start[Start runtime] --> Prepare[Connect pools and warm queue]
  Prepare --> Retry[Retry unavailable database with backoff]
  Prepare --> Lock[Acquire PostgreSQL advisory lock]
  Lock -->|held elsewhere| Wait[Wait and retry]
  Wait --> Lock
  Lock -->|leader| Tick[Check schedule and UTC metrics slot]
  Tick --> Enqueue[Enqueue due tasks with stable keys]
  Enqueue --> Tick
  Tick -->|database unavailable| Release[Session ends and leadership reacquired]
  Release --> Retry
  Tick -->|shutdown| Stop[Stop scheduler]
